{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5572350","formula":"C₁₈H₃₂N₆O₆","hill":"C18H32N6O6","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":18.0,"H":32.0,"N":6.0,"O":6.0},"names":{"en":"Glucosepane","ru":"Глюкозепан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Glucosepane is a lysine-arginine protein cross-linking product and advanced glycation end product (AGE) derived from D-glucose. It is an irreversible, covalent cross-link product that has been found to make intermolecular and intramolecular cross-links in the collagen of the extracellular matrix (ECM) and crystallin of the eyes. Covalent protein cross-links irreversibly link proteins together in the ECM of tissues.","ru":"Глюкозепан (англ. Glucosepane) — результат ковалентного поперечного сшивания лизина и аргинина производной от молекулы D-глюкозы, конечный продукт гликирования. Образует как внутримолекулярные, так и межмолекулярные необратимые сшивки коллагена во внеклеточном матриксе, а также кристаллина в хрусталике глаза, нарушая функционирование тканей."},"fame":6,"pubchemCid":124220628,"mass":428.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1[C@@H]([C@@H](CN(C2=NC(=NC21)NCCC[C@@H](C(=O)O)N)CCCC[C@@H](C(=O)O)N)O)O","inchikey":"JTMICRULXGWYCN-WSOGJNRSSA-N","iupac":"(2S)-2-amino-6-[(6R,7S)-2-[[(4S)-4-amino-4-carboxybutyl]amino]-6,7-dihydroxy-6,7,8,8a-tetrahydro-5H-imidazo[4,5-b]azepin-4-yl]hexanoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"124220628","atoms":62,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.369,"y":2.919,"z":0.584,"el":"C"},{"x":0.758,"y":3.751,"z":-0.022,"el":"C"},{"x":2.087,"y":3.007,"z":-0.246,"el":"C"},{"x":1.999,"y":1.829,"z":-1.232,"el":"C"},{"x":1.427,"y":0.628,"z":-0.623,"el":"N"},{"x":0.122,"y":0.578,"z":-0.189,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.47,"y":-0.436,"z":0.35,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.749,"y":-0.034,"z":0.606,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.0